Z||000000||rodmcneill||12-15-2001||12:45 AM||||My local Pep Boys had a great hardware department, all kinds of bolts, washers, fittings. Notice I said had. I went in today to get some bolts and 90% of the hardware was gone, replaced by RICER PARTS! All kinds of crap, and most of it low grade Chinese junk. It looks like I will have to find another source for hardware.||||reg||13
Z||000001||My7Fieros||12-15-2001||12:49 AM||||Yeah Ive noticed some Autozones are carrying a wide variety of cheap-o ricer accessories. They still seem to carry all their normal stuff though. I always like to go over to the ricer section when there are people who are looking at it. I start picking up pieces and laughing and shaking my head. Makes the people who are wanting to buy that crap think twice lol.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><I>Although....</I> they do have some pretty cool looking carbon fiber like shift knobs.||||reg||1
